# Raw run output stays local: per-run test logs (~91 MB) and per-sample latency CSVs (~180 MB).
# The bandwidth and phase-profile CSVs that RESULTS.md and the compare scripts read are committed
# (the repository's root .gitignore excludes *.csv, so they are re-included here).
*.log
!*.csv
results/*_latency.csv
# Raw PC samples (pc_sampler.py, ~10-20 MB per row); the per-section summaries derived from them are committed.
results/*_samples.bin
__pycache__/
# Router ELFs saved by the run scripts (tens of GB): variants/<v>/elf/ and consolidation/builds/ stay local.
variants/*/elf/
consolidation/builds/
# Hang captures (device-state dumps) and source snapshots (.tgz) stay local: raw artifacts, like the logs.
results/*_hangcap/
results/*.tgz
# Raw run output in per-run subdirectories stays local too: per-sample latency CSVs, zone samples, numpy dumps and
# hang captures (results/<run>/...), the latency sweep's per-sample CSVs, and the regression runner's raw test logs
# and junit files (testplan/results/.../log.txt, junit/); their summaries (status.json, compare_*.md/csv) are committed.
results/**/*_latency.csv
results/**/*_zones.csv
results/**/*.npz
results/**/*_hangcap/
latsweep/results/*.csv
testplan/results/**/log.txt
testplan/results/**/junit/
